{"id":"religion","lemma":"religion","pos":"noun","rank":2294,"glosses":["religion"],"ipa":"/ʁə.li.ʒjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/Fr-religion.ogg/Fr-religion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"religions"},"formAudio":{"religions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-religions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je n'ai aucune religion.","en":"I have no religion.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Vous devriez penser à leurs religions.","en":"You should think of their religions.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to think"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null]},{"text":"C'est contre ma religion.","en":"It's against my religion.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"As-tu de la religion ?","en":"Are you religious?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Ne me parle pas de religion !","en":"Don't talk to me about religion.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}